---
import Layout from "@/components/layout.astro";
import "@/styles/global.css";

const nav = [
	{ href: "/", label: "Docs" },
	{ href: "/visualize", label: "Visualize" },
	{ href: "/visualize/cli", label: "CLI" },
	{ href: "/visualize/machine", label: "Machine" },
	{ href: "/visualize/contract-machine-server", label: "M↔S" },
	{ href: "/visualize/contract-server-web", label: "S↔W" },
	{ href: "/visualize/architecture", label: "Arch" },
];
---
<Layout>
  <title>Visualize architecture — UMA</title>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-fd-background text-fd-foreground">
    <header class="border-b border-fd-border">
      <nav class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center gap-1 px-4 py-3 text-sm">
        {nav.map((n) => (
          <a href={n.href} class="rounded-md px-2.5 py-1.5 text-fd-muted-foreground hover:bg-fd-accent hover:text-fd-accent-foreground">{n.label}</a>
        ))}
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-fd-muted-foreground">visualize/architecture · sources: apps/machine, apps/orpc-contract, apps/web, apps/infra</p>
      <h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl font-semibold">Connection & architecture</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-fd-muted-foreground">End-to-end flow from operator to sandbox to browser. Detail: <a class="text-fd-primary hover:underline" href="/architecture/overview">/architecture/overview</a>.</p>

      <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-fd-border bg-fd-card p-5 font-mono text-xs md:text-sm overflow-x-auto">
        <pre>{`┌──────────┐  enroll (/device/code→/token)  ┌────────┐  ws /api/machines/ws   ┌─────────────────┐
│ operator │ ───────────────────────────────▶ │ server │ ◀═════════════════════ │ uma-machine daemon │
│ (CLI)    │  identity.json/limits/state.db   │ (auth) │  heartbeat/log/done   │  + microsandbox    │
└──────────┘                                  │ tasks  │ ─── assign/cancel ───▶ │  + agent binary    │
                                              │ queue  │ ◀── claim (409 wins)── │  (quota→claim→exec)│
                                              └───┬────┘                         └─────────────────┘
                                                  │ POST /api/rpc/*
                                                  ▼
                                              ┌────────┐  TanStack Query  ┌─────────┐
                                              │  web   │ ◀══════════════ │ browser │
                                              │ (oRPC) │  tasks/signals/… │ (Start) │
                                              └───┬────┘                  └─────────┘
                                                  │ Drizzle
                                                  ▼
                                              ┌──────────┐      Pulumi (OCI+CF+Docker)
                                              │ Postgres │ ◀──── apps/infra ── dev: local Docker
                                              └──────────┘`}</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-fd-border bg-fd-card p-5">
          <h2 class="font-semibold">1 · Enroll</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground"><code class="font-mono">uma-machine enroll</code> → device flow → <code class="font-mono">identity.json (0600)</code>, <code class="font-mono">limits.json</code>, <code class="font-mono">state.db</code>, optional systemd unit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-fd-border bg-fd-card p-5">
          <h2 class="font-semibold">2 · Daemon loop</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">Bearer WS + persist-first heartbeat (30s) + TTL reap of stopped sandboxes. Dispatches assign / cancel / reset-config / UPGRADE_REQUIRED.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-fd-border bg-fd-card p-5">
          <h2 class="font-semibold">3 · Execute</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">quota → atomic claim (409 authoritative) → start → git bind (<code class="font-mono">task/&lt;short&gt;</code>) → redacted exec → <code class="font-mono">task-done</code> → stop.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-fd-border bg-fd-card p-5">
          <h2 class="font-semibold">4 · Web product</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">Signal → Task (queued) → assign → running → completed/failed. Frontend polls <code class="font-mono">tasks.list/stats</code> over <code class="font-mono">POST /api/rpc/*</code>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-fd-border p-5 text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground">
        <span class="font-semibold text-fd-foreground">Status gaps (verified):</span> web has no machine registry or WS server yet (<code class="font-mono">settings/machines.tsx</code> placeholder; <code class="font-mono">server-central/</code> is the local test harness). Contract-first <code class="font-mono">device.* / machines.*</code> await <code class="font-mono">implement(apiContract)</code>. Infra paths still reference pre-move locations — see <a class="text-fd-primary hover:underline" href="/architecture/overview">/architecture/overview</a>.
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>
